# The platforms a release carries a zip for, one per line, each <GOOS>-<GOARCH>.
#
# This is the list the release workflow walks: one zip per line, named
# gdoc-<tag>-<platform>.zip, with one SHA256SUMS-<tag> covering all of them. It
# is also the list install.sh offers, and the two are compared on every commit,
# so a platform in one and not the other cannot reach a colleague.
#
# Windows joins this list after a colleague has run its checklist. `make dist`
# already builds windows-amd64, but no gdoc has ever replaced a running gdoc.exe
# on Windows, so it is not offered as an install until somebody has done it once
# by hand.
darwin-arm64
darwin-amd64
